      <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ScholarlyArticle","author":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Simon McCallum","url":"https://independent.academia.edu/SimonMcCallum","image":"https://gravatar.com/avatar/eab9e5bb3cb6bf5107c95e10da1fb78a?s=200","sameAs":[]}],"contributor":[],"dateCreated":"2021-12-03","datePublished":"2010-01-01","headline":"Game Design for Computer Science Education","image":"https://attachments.academia-assets.com/75676862/thumbnails/1.jpg","inLanguage":"en","keywords":[],"publication":"Norsk informatikkonferanse (NIK)","publisher":{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"tapironline.no"},"sourceOrganization":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"EducationalOrganization","name":null}],"thumbnailUrl":"https://attachments.academia-assets.com/75676862/thumbnails/1.jpg","url":"https://www.academia.edu/63162458/Game_Design_for_Computer_Science_Education"}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","about":{"@type":"ScholarlyArticle","name":"Game Design for Computer Science Education","url":"https://www.academia.edu/63162458/Game_Design_for_Computer_Science_Education"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What role does instant feedback play in student engagement during computer science education?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The paper reveals that instant feedback increases student engagement and retention significantly, with pair programming and game content enhancing this effect. For instance, feedback mechanisms in games provide immediate performance assessments, which contrasts with delay in traditional education systems."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does game design mimic effective instructional strategies in computer science education?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The research demonstrates that game mechanics align closely with modern learning theories, including fast feedback and challenge cycles, enhancing skill development. Notably, good games create a flow state that mirrors effective instructional environments."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the consequences of using confidence-based marking in assessments?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The study indicates confidence-based marking can lead to a 66% average correctness among students, despite overconfidence skewing responses. This approach also positively correlated with the students’ performance in short answer sections."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When was the XP-based assessment system first implemented in Indiana University courses?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"XP-based assessments were introduced in fall 2010 at Indiana University by Lee Sheldon, using gaming principles to foster engagement. The system allowed for unique motivations, such as leveling up for additional supports and resources."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do RPG character sheets influence student motivation and skill development?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Utilizing RPG character sheets helps track skills and encourages reflection on learning objectives, thus enhancing motivation by providing recognizable learning formats. This method mirrors game mechanics that allow players to visualize and evaluate progression."}}]}</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="//a.academia-assets.com/assets/design_system/default_tokens/rebrand-89afffb91e093c5385bc943212566acb82d8da08820977c439fbb6656b3d411c.css" media="all" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="//a.academia-assets.com/assets/single_work_page/loswp_redesigns/outline_variant-16699a3e67d177ed1995c88dff607e971df9b03818babf220275b4ae9a95e71c.css" media="all" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="//a.academia-assets.com/assets/single_work_page/outline-81167b90d0109620221d366e55ca8f498a621752df59ae26b6678cf0870d7f37.css" media="all" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="//a.academia-assets.com/assets/design_system/body-c50f5ab98832f511df8842993148351135752147645352dc0b07c369bcb29ab7.css" media="all" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="//a.academia-assets.com/assets/design_system/button-4d6745f84a0a0d8316c46d93a0bc87b9c96d3bce729ca2b864b618764cddd832.css" media="all" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="//a.academia-assets.com/assets/design_system/heading-95367dc03b794f6737f30123738a886cf53b7a65cdef98a922a98591d60063e3.css" media="all" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="//a.academia-assets.com/assets/design_system/text_button-d1941ab08e91e29ee143084c4749da4aaffa350a2ac6eec2306b1d7a352d911a.css" media="all" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="//a.academia-assets.com/assets/single_work_page/ai_label-529f80fc4bfd876bcf14704d39f2468fffef86fe603e426ab9a313e3abd3ac37.css" media="all" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="//a.academia-assets.com/assets/single_work_page/ordered_list-9123030494f589694fc98dd7b689a70398eb527516b541b1c648dce5ab690c12.css" media="all" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="//a.academia-assets.com/assets/about_hiring/footer-4b1d1471325a90ac5ba51422db929bc292e3d4469d0fabb80d93ab2310ff2719.css" media="all" /><link rel="preload" href="//a.academia-assets.com/fonts/design_system/DM-Sans_100-1000_normal_latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"><link rel="preload" href="//a.academia-assets.com/fonts/design_system/Gupter_400_normal_latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"><link rel="preload" href="//a.academia-assets.com/fonts/design_system/Material-Symbols-Outlined.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"><link rel="preload" href="//a.academia-assets.com/fonts/design_system/Roboto_100-900_normal_latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"><link rel="stylesheet" href="//a.academia-assets.com/assets/design_system/font-faces-2356cee1de094354769ab30bf9bb930e5f4cdeb0a4f2cce7272a440eecfa7de9.css" media="all" /><style>.material-symbols-outlined {
