ls><details class="work-faq--item" data-faq-number="3"><summary class="work-faq--question js-faq-question"><span class="work-faq--question-text" data-question="What are the consequences of using confidence-based marking in assessments?">What are the consequences of using confidence-based marking in assessments?</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined work-faq--icon" style="font-size: 16px" translate="no">add</span></summary><div class="work-faq--answer"><p class="ds2-5-body-md">The study indicates confidence-based marking can lead to a 66% average correctness among students, despite overconfidence skewing responses. This approach also positively correlated with the students’ performance in short answer sections.</p></div></details><details class="work-faq--item" data-faq-number="4"><summary class="work-faq--question js-faq-question"><span class="work-faq--question-text" data-question="When was the XP-based assessment system first implemented in Indiana University courses?">When was the XP-based assessment system first implemented in Indiana University courses?</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined work-faq--icon" style="font-size: 16px" translate="no">add</span></summary><div class="work-faq--answer"><p class="ds2-5-body-md">XP-based assessments were introduced in fall 2010 at Indiana University by Lee Sheldon, using gaming principles to foster engagement. The system allowed for unique motivations, such as leveling up for additional supports and resources.</p></div></details><details class="work-faq--item" data-faq-number="5"><summary class="work-faq--question js-faq-question"><span class="work-faq--question-text" data-question="How do RPG character sheets influence student motivation and skill development?">How do RPG character sheets influence student motivation and skill development?</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined work-faq--icon" style="font-size: 16px" translate="no">add</span></summary><div class="work-faq--answer"><p class="ds2-5-body-md">Utilizing RPG character sheets helps track skills and encourages reflection on learning objectives, thus enhancing motivation by providing recognizable learning formats. This method mirrors game mechanics that allow players to visualize and evaluate progression.</p></div></details></div></div><script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
