});</script><script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => { const loginButton = document.querySelector('.js-login-button--62c2549d'); if (!loginButton) { throw new Error('Login button not found'); } const options = { detail: {"postLoginRedirectUrl":"https://www.academia.edu/32307836/The_impact_of_game_design_on_students_interest_in_CS","clickTrackingContext":{"source":"loswp--wsj-grid-card-download-pdf-modal","bucket":"outline","entity_id":32307836,"extra":{"source_work_id":32307836}},"configuredText":{"buttonsPage":{"header":"Read your PDF for free"},"emailEntryPage":{"subheader":"Sign up or log in to continue reading."},"emailLoginPage":{"subheader":"Log in to continue reading."},"emailRegistrationPage":{"subheader":"Sign up to continue reading."}},"registrationParams":{"user_source":"download","doc_id":52521474}} }; loginButton.addEventListener('click', () => { document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('open-login-modal', options)); }); });</script><a class="ds2-5-text-link ds2-5-text-link--inline js-related-work-grid-card-view-pdf" href="https://www.academia.edu/32307836/The_impact_of_game_design_on_students_interest_in_CS"><span class="ds2-5-text-link__content">View PDF</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 18px" translate="no">chevron_right</span></a></div></div><div class="ds-related-work--container js-related-work-sidebar-card js-safe-related-work-related-work " data-collection-position="3" data-entity-id="73222929" data-sort-order="default"><a class="ds-related-work--title js-related-work-grid-card-title ds2-5-body-md ds2-5-body-link" href="https://www.academia.edu/73222929/Use_of_Game_Development_in_Computer_Science_and_Software_Engineering_Education">Use of Game Development in Computer Science and Software Engineering Education</a><div class="ds-related-work--metadata"><a class="js-related-work-grid-card-author ds2-5-body-sm ds2-5-body-link" data-author-id="11626208" href="https://ntnu-no.academia.edu/AWang">Alf Inge Wang</a></div><p class="ds-related-work--metadata ds2-5-body-xs">2015</p><p class="ds2-5-body-sm ds-related-work--abstract hide-on-large">This chapter presents the results of a literature survey on the use of game development in software engineering (SE) and computer science (CS) education. Games and game development has been used in recent years to increase motivation, engagement and learning, and to promote doing career in software and computers. The authors of this chapter wanted to get a bird’s eye perspective on how game development has been used in the recent years to teach other things than just game development. The literature survey includes research articles from the period 2004 to 2012, and it investigates among other things in what context game development has being used, the subjects and topics taught through game development, and what tools and frameworks being used for game development to learn SE and CS. Further, this chapter includes a description of how game development was used in our software architecture course at the Norwegian University of Science and Technology, and the gained experiences from ...</p><div class="ds-related-work--ctas"><a class="ds2-5-text-link ds2-5-text-link--inline js-tc-loswp--wsj-grid-card-download-pdf-modal js-login-button--2af91993"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 18px" translate="no">download</span><span class="ds2-5-text-link__content">Download free PDF</span></a><script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
